<!-- §tile-icons (post-v1.0): the Quick Share "Files" tile glyph — a
     STACKED-DOCUMENTS mark (two overlapping pages, the front one
     corner-folded), the standard "files" metaphor in professional file
     managers. Multi-path detail replaces the old single outline page,
     which read as a bare rectangle at 22dp. -->
